OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786497480
OL,3,CSpecialist glasses sell out as Britons
OL,4,Cprepare for best solar eclipse in
OL,5,Cdecades
OL,7,FThese include the coasts of Norfolk,
OL,8,FYorkshire and Aberdeenshire, as well
OL,9,Fas the Orkney and Shetland Islands.
OL,11,FIn an added bonus for stargazers, the
OL,12,Fannual Perseid meteor shower reaches
OL,13,Fits peak on the night of August 12-13,
OL,14,Fhours after the eclipse.
OL,16,FThe shower is produced as Earth
OL,17,Fploughs through a stream of dust left
OL,18,Fbehind by Comet Swift`Tuttle.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
