PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786497480
OL,3,CSpecialist glasses sell out as Britons
OL,4,Cprepare for best solar eclipse in
OL,5,Cdecades
OL,7,FEach tiny grain strikes Earth's
OL,8,Fatmosphere at about 60 kilometres per
OL,9,Fsecond, burning up in a brief flash
OL,10,Fthat takes the appearance of a
OL,11,Fshooting star.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
